# Keep the build context small and deterministic.
#
# `node_modules` is installed inside the image from the lockfile, so sending the
# host's copy would only slow the build and risk a native module built for the
# wrong platform. `engines-src` holds read-only engine clones and is never part
# of a build. Secrets are excluded so a stray `.env` cannot be baked into a layer.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.tsbuildinfo

engines-src
.git
.github
.agent_tmp

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.log
.DS_Store
docs
tests
